Add the default-off --user-defined-operators option for fallback arithmetic and
comparison function operators declared directly on concrete classes and
inductive datatypes. Requires --type-system-refresh. Uses are ordinary calls;
equality and inequality remain intrinsic. The initial milestone supports fully
checked source and revealed exports, and rejects override mode, compounds,
trait/newtype/codatatype operators, feature-bearing refinement/abstract views,
and library/precompiled input reuse.
